OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Fshower at first, otherwise a dry and
OL,7,Fbright evening. It will stay mostly
OL,8,Fdry overnight with a few clear spells
OL,9,Fand just the chance of the odd brief
OL,10,Fshower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAnother very warm or hot
OL,13,Fday. Mainly dry and bright with some
OL,14,Fsunny spells, though the sunshine
OL,15,Fturning hazy at times. Small chance of
OL,16,Fthe odd passing shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
