OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith some showers Friday morning. Then
OL,7,Fbright spells and variable cloud the
OL,8,Frest of the period, mainly dry but the
OL,9,Fodd shower possible at times, less
OL,10,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
